---
description: Investigate the exact installed package and explain its review scope without changing source.
args:
  goal: string
returns: InstalledPackageInvestigation
---
Use discoverPackage and inspectPackage to join the actual assignment, deployed worker declaration and current/baseline manifest. Use decidePackage to examine those actual native facts and explain the actual declaration, plan identity and any restoration authority relevant to the goal. Distinguish an admitted inspection from permission to mutate; preserve genuine foreign, stale or withdrawn scope evidence. Return the exact assignment, observation and finding for the caller's decision; this investigation does not restore source or execute a suite.
